{"id": "DeoV5BgCEN1", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "The shop's payment speaker never talks to your phone. So how does it know you paid? 🔊\n\nInside: a speaker, a battery, a chip and its own SIM card (some models use Wi-Fi). It stays online all day, connected to the payment company's servers.\n\nYou scan and pay, UPI moves the money between banks, and the moment the shop's bank confirms it, the server finds the box linked to that QR code and sends it a tiny message. The chip plays \"₹100 received\" in the shopkeeper's language.\n\nThat's why a fake payment screenshot can't make it speak. Shopkeepers: trust the box, not the screenshot.\n\nSend this to a shopkeeper you know 🙏\n\n#upi #paytm #phonepe #howtechworks #techexplained", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792339203, "like_count": 5, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18141394138575820a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 68.187, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQM0sJohlHvDoQCOOuD_sWUYLxwbSRuPfYbFxYarbFQU7KEyyW7sXNbZOTvx34T0fMSn7AbHu30ldiJ8Bf2DxPA9Z6m-Tr8d9i-wjYw.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdoG8vegZ6bpxpaJrtYLczy7WlWyA3eJ6IEbTnEqlK-8ThfOHBXJT9-35bIpJzM7XbF1kob4Z6k4NFMtGyYQca84&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=CHJibFOV5bYQ7kNvwGjasl6&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=9w9faFS0A3Xv77dGzfR_cg&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQS85ElQoGJLFmCpulcD1TiVHIfOthaNhD0FFyBitFU9TA&oe=6AF42279", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 68.187, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/5